    <string name="device_infotitle">Device status info</string>
    <string name="device_infomsg">In this section, you can monitor and view the status of your device.\n\nCPU usage: here you can view real-time processor usage for each core, such as the current frequency or current usage percentage.\n\nGPU usage: here you can view real-time graphics processor usage, such as the current frequency or current usage percentage.\n\nMemory usage: here you can view the real-time RAM and ZRAM (virtual) memory usage, such as the current frequency or current usage percentage.\n\nThermal status: here you can view the temperature of the CPU, GPU, and battery.\n\nBattery status: here you can view the battery\'s capacity or health.</string>
